{
  "version": "2026.11.08-1",
  "description": "AI services recognised by the Policy Analyzer AI usage panel. A domain matches itself and every subdomain (suffix match on DNS query names and TLS SNI). Edit this file in the source tree, or add services/domains/known hosts in /usr/local/etc/policyanalyzer/ai-services.local.json (same format, merged over this one, survives package upgrades). Keep generic shared domains (googleapis.com, bing.com, cloudfront.net...) out: they would be counted as AI.",
